WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.586
Tom was playing with his sisters.

2
00:00:05.587 --> 00:00:10.891
The three kittens played in the yard.

3
00:00:10.892 --> 00:00:17.429
They chased butterflies.

4
00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:26.412
They played tag.

5
00:00:26.413 --> 00:00:34.719
But soon Tom got bored.

6
00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:39.856
Tom looked toward the gate.

7
00:00:39.857 --> 00:00:52.155
"Hmm," he thought. "What's that?"

8
00:00:52.156 --> 00:00:56.391
Tom crawled under the gate.

9
00:00:56.392 --> 00:01:00.019
"Where are you going, Tom?" Moppet asked.

10
00:01:00.020 --> 00:01:04.018
Tom did not answer.

11
00:01:04.019 --> 00:01:09.935
So Moppet crawled under the gate too.

12
00:01:09.936 --> 00:01:12.899
Mittens frowned at Tom and Moppet.

13
00:01:12.900 --> 00:01:18.211
"Don't go near the road!" she said.

14
00:01:18.212 --> 00:01:25.252
Tom and Moppet ran toward the road.

15
00:01:25.253 --> 00:01:34.769
"Mittens!" Tom said. "Look what we found!"

16
00:01:34.770 --> 00:01:37.991
Mittens crawled under the gate.

17
00:01:37.992 --> 00:01:41.607
She ran to her brother and sister.

18
00:01:41.608 --> 00:01:45.803
"We found a box!" Moppet said.

19
00:01:45.804 --> 00:01:49.102
The kittens jumped into the wooden box.

20
00:01:49.103 --> 00:01:53.008
It was full of wool.

21
00:01:53.009 --> 00:01:57.810
"It's cozy in here," Moppet said.

22
00:01:57.817 --> 00:02:06.475
"It's a secret hiding place!" said Tom.

23
00:02:06.476 --> 00:02:11.694
Mittens looked worried.

24
00:02:11.695 --> 00:02:15.582
"We have to go home soon," she said.

25
00:02:15.583 --> 00:02:19.121
Suddenly Tom heard a man's voice.

26
00:02:19.122 --> 00:02:23.882
It was the farmer.

27
00:02:23.883 --> 00:02:26.280
Then the box went up.

28
00:02:26.281 --> 00:02:31.638
"Uh-oh," Tom thought.

